<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> 15Mar/15Apr    5/15 P     15Mar/15Apr    5/15 P</p>
<p> April	    1/7  P     April	    1/7  P</p>
<p> May/97	 5 D/even     May/97	 5 D/even</p>
