<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	  PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> December	 16/17 P   December	16/17 P</p>
<p> January/97     17/19 P   January/97    17/19 P</p>
<p> March/97	    15 DB  March/97	   15 DB</p>
<p> May/97		17 DB  May/97	     17 DB</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
